<div class="diagram-box">
<pre>
  📝 you DECLARE intent    ──▶    🔄 control loops    ──▶    ⚙️ K8s makes it real &amp; KEEPS it true
     "3 copies of easypj"          reconcile forever         restart · reschedule · scale
</pre>
</div>
