            <div class="cka-practice-drill">
                <h4>🔬 Practice Drill 1.5 — Read the Error, Name the API-Server Stage</h4>
                <div class="drill-timer">⏱️ Target Time: 4 minutes</div>
                <div class="drill-scenario">
                    <h5>Scenario</h5>
                    <p>From <em>Under the Hood</em> you know every write passes through a 6-stage apiserver pipeline (authN → authZ → mutating → schema → validating → etcd). For each real error message, name the <strong>stage that rejected it</strong> and the fix:</p>
                    <ol>
                        <li><code>Error from server (Forbidden): deployments.apps is forbidden: User "dev" cannot create resource "deployments"…</code></li>
                        <li><code>error validating data: ValidationError(Deployment.spec): unknown field "replica"</code></li>
                        <li><code>Error from server: admission webhook "pod-policy" denied the request: runAsNonRoot required</code></li>
                        <li><code>Unable to connect to the server: x509: certificate has expired or is not yet valid</code></li>
                    </ol>
                </div>
                <div class="drill-hint">
