                            <div class="eq-explanation">
                                <div class="eq-exp-label">Explanation</div>
                                <p>The <code>--sort-by</code> flag accepts a JSONPath expression. This is frequently tested on the CKA for diagnostic questions like "find the pod with the most restarts" or "show the most recent events." Key gotcha: <code>--sort-by</code> sorts in ascending order. To get descending, pipe to <code>tail</code> or <code>tac</code>: <code>kubectl get pods --sort-by='.status.containerStatuses[0].restartCount' | tail -5</code>. For events, the timestamp sort is essential when debugging cascading failures.</p>
