<pre><code class="language-bash">lsmod | grep -E "overlay|br_netfilter"                     <span class="comment"># both modules present</span>
sysctl net.bridge.bridge-nf-call-iptables net.ipv4.ip_forward
<span class="comment"># net.bridge.bridge-nf-call-iptables = 1
# net.ipv4.ip_forward = 1</span></code></pre>
</div>
                        <div class="eq-explanation"><div class="eq-exp-label">Explanation</div><p>Without them, pods may schedule but can't reach Services or other nodes — a confusing "networking just doesn't work" failure.</p></div>
