  🗂️  HR deciding which desk a hire sits ─────▶  Ch 14 — the scheduler
     at (near storage? away from noise?)           (affinity, taints, topology spread)
  💰 The office budget — no team can   ─────▶   Ch 15 — requests/limits, LimitRange,
     hog every meeting room                       ResourceQuota, QoS classes
