                    <div class="info-card highlight">
                        <div class="card-icon-lg">🏋️</div>
                        <h5>Exercise 14.2: Node Affinity</h5>
                        <p>1. Label <code>node01</code> with <code>disktype=ssd</code><br>
                        2. Create pod with required nodeAffinity for ssd nodes<br>
