                        4. Scale to 4 — what happens if only 3 nodes?</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="info-card highlight">
                        <div class="card-icon-lg">🏋️</div>
                        <h5>Exercise 14.4: Node Maintenance</h5>
                        <p>1. Cordon worker-1<br>
                        2. Deploy nginx (replicas: 3) — verify none land on worker-1<br>
