                    <h5>Scenario</h5>
                    <ol>
                        <li>On one node, run one BestEffort pod, one Burstable pod, and one Guaranteed pod (as in Drill 15.1)</li>
                        <li>Explain, without triggering it, the exact order the kubelet would evict them under node memory pressure</li>
                        <li>Within the Burstable class specifically, what's the tie-breaker if two Burstable pods exist on the same node?</li>
                        <li>Re-label the BestEffort pod's resources to make it Guaranteed instead — how does the eviction order change?</li>
                    </ol>
