            <div class="uth-body">
            <h5>🗺️ CoreDNS — The Cluster's Internal DNS Server</h5>
            <p>CoreDNS replaces kube-dns as the cluster DNS server. It runs as a Deployment (2 replicas by default) and is exposed via the <code>kube-dns</code> Service. Every pod's <code>/etc/resolv.conf</code> points to it.</p>
