                <p class="mb-0">Without Ingress, each Service would need its own separate external LoadBalancer. With Ingress, ONE entry point does host/path-based routing to all of them — and just like a Service needs endpoints, an Ingress needs a running CONTROLLER or it does nothing at all (Ch 20 covers this in full, plus its 2025 successor, Gateway API, in Ch 20b).</p>
