<span class="comment"># Name:      kubernetes.default</span>
<span class="comment"># Address 1: 10.96.0.1  ← API server's Service IP</span>

<span class="comment"># If DNS works, kubernetes.default always resolves</span>
<span class="comment"># It's the built-in kubernetes API Service</span>

<span class="comment"># If DNS fails, deeper checks:</span>
<span class="comment"># 1. Is CoreDNS running?</span>
kubectl get pods -n kube-system -l k8s-app=kube-dns

<span class="comment"># 2. Is kube-dns Service accessible?</span>
