            <section class="section-block" id="s20-1">
                <h3 class="section-h">20.1 Ingress — HTTP/HTTPS Routing</h3>
                <p>An <strong>Ingress</strong> is an API object that manages external HTTP/HTTPS access to Services. It provides <strong>path-based routing</strong>, <strong>host-based routing</strong>, and <strong>TLS termination</strong> — all features that NodePort/LoadBalancer Services lack.</p>

                <div class="diagram-container">
                    <div class="diagram-title">Ingress — How External HTTP Traffic Is Routed</div>
<div class="diagram-box">
<pre>
  Internet user: https://easypj.example.com/api/jobs/
                 https://easypj.example.com/admin/

  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
  │                                                                  │
  │  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐       │
  │  │  Ingress Controller (NGINX / Traefik / HAProxy)      │       │
  │  │  Deployed as a pod, exposed via LoadBalancer/NodePort │       │
  │  │  Reads Ingress rules from API server                 │       │
  │  └───────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────┘       │
  │                      │                                           │
  │          ┌───────────┼────────────┐                             │
  │          │           │            │                              │
  │   path: /api/*  path: /admin/*  path: /static/*                │
  │          │           │            │                              │
  │   ┌──────▼─────┐ ┌──▼────────┐ ┌─▼───────────┐                │
  │   │ easypj-svc │ │ admin-svc │ │  static-svc │                │
  │   │ port: 80   │ │ port: 80  │ │  port: 80   │                │
  │   └──────┬─────┘ └──┬────────┘ └─┬───────────┘                │
  │          │           │            │                              │
  │   ┌──────▼─────┐ ┌──▼────────┐ ┌─▼───────────┐                │
  │   │ easypj     │ │ easypj    │ │  nginx      │                │
  │   │ pods       │ │ pods      │ │  pods       │                │
  │   └────────────┘ └───────────┘ └─────────────┘                │
  │                                                                  │
  │  Benefits over NodePort/LoadBalancer:                           │
  │  ✅ Single external IP for multiple services                   │
  │  ✅ Path-based and host-based routing                          │
  │  ✅ TLS termination at the edge                                │
  │  ✅ Centralized SSL certificate management                     │
  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
</pre>
</div>
                </div>

                <div class="code-block-wrapper">
                    <div class="code-block-header">
                        <span class="code-dot red"></span>
                        <span class="code-dot yellow"></span>
                        <span class="code-dot green"></span>
                        <span class="code-lang">easypj-ingress.yaml</span>
                    </div>
<pre><code class="language-yaml">apiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1
kind: Ingress
metadata:
  name: easypj-ingress
  namespace: default
  annotations:
    nginx.ingress.kubernetes.io/rewrite-target: /
spec:
  ingressClassName: nginx         <span class="comment"># Which Ingress Controller to use</span>
  tls:                             <span class="comment"># TLS termination</span>
    - hosts:
        - easypj.example.com
      secretName: easypj-tls       <span class="comment"># TLS cert stored in a Secret</span>
  rules:
    - host: easypj.example.com     <span class="comment"># Host-based routing</span>
      http:
        paths:
          - path: /api              <span class="comment"># Path-based routing</span>
            pathType: Prefix        <span class="comment"># Prefix or Exact</span>
            backend:
              service:
                name: easypj-svc   <span class="comment"># Route to this Service</span>
                port:
                  number: 80
          - path: /admin
            pathType: Prefix
            backend:
              service:
                name: easypj-svc
                port:
                  number: 80
    - host: docs.example.com       <span class="comment"># Different host → different Service</span>
      http:
        paths:
          - path: /
            pathType: Prefix
            backend:
              service:
                name: docs-svc
                port:
                  number: 80</code></pre>
                </div>

                <div class="comparison-table">
                    <table>
                        <thead>
                            <tr>
                                <th>pathType</th>
                                <th>Match Behavior</th>
                                <th>Example</th>
                            </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody>
                            <tr>
                                <td><strong>Prefix</strong></td>
                                <td>Matches URL path prefix by <code>/</code> segments</td>
                                <td><code>/api</code> matches <code>/api</code>, <code>/api/</code>, <code>/api/jobs</code></td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td><strong>Exact</strong></td>
                                <td>Exact URL path match (case-sensitive)</td>
                                <td><code>/api</code> matches only <code>/api</code>, NOT <code>/api/</code></td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td><strong>ImplementationSpecific</strong></td>
                                <td>Depends on the IngressClass / controller</td>
                                <td>Behavior varies — avoid on exam</td>
                            </tr>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>

                <div class="code-block-wrapper">
                    <div class="code-block-header">
                        <span class="code-dot red"></span>
                        <span class="code-dot yellow"></span>
                        <span class="code-dot green"></span>
                        <span class="code-lang">Working with Ingress Resources</span>
                    </div>
<pre><code class="language-bash"><span class="comment"># Apply the Ingress</span>
kubectl apply -f easypj-ingress.yaml

<span class="comment"># Check Ingress — look for ADDRESS (external IP)</span>
kubectl get ingress
<span class="comment"># NAME             CLASS   HOSTS                  ADDRESS        PORTS     AGE</span>
<span class="comment"># easypj-ingress  nginx   easypj.example.com     203.0.113.50   80, 443   5s</span>

<span class="comment"># Describe for detailed routing info</span>
kubectl describe ingress easypj-ingress
<span class="comment"># Rules:</span>
<span class="comment">#   Host                  Path  Backends</span>
<span class="comment">#   ----                  ----  --------</span>
<span class="comment">#   easypj.example.com</span>
<span class="comment">#                         /api    easypj-svc:80 (10.244.1.5:8000,10.244.2.3:8000)</span>
<span class="comment">#                         /admin  easypj-svc:80 (10.244.1.5:8000,10.244.2.3:8000)</span>

<span class="comment"># Create TLS Secret for HTTPS</span>
kubectl create secret tls easypj-tls \
  --cert=tls.crt --key=tls.key -n default</code></pre>
                </div>

                <div class="diagram-container">
                    <div class="diagram-title">TLS Termination at Ingress — HTTPS Flow</div>
<div class="diagram-box">
<pre>
  Browser: https://easypj.example.com/api/jobs/

  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
  │                                                                  │
  │  ┌──────────┐     HTTPS (443)      ┌──────────────────────┐    │
  │  │  Client   │ ═══════════════════▶ │  Ingress Controller  │    │
  │  │ (Browser) │    TLS encrypted     │  (NGINX pod)         │    │
