                    <p><strong>Task:</strong> In the <code>easypj-prod</code> namespace, create a NetworkPolicy so that <strong>only</strong> the easypj web pods can access the postgres pods on port 5432. All other ingress traffic to postgres must be denied. Pods must still be able to resolve DNS.</p>
