            <strong>🔑 CKA Insight:</strong> NetworkPolicy requires a CNI that supports it (Calico, Cilium, Weave). Flannel does NOT support NetworkPolicy by default. On the CKA, if you create a NetworkPolicy and it doesn't work, verify: (1) <code>kubectl get networkpolicy</code> — does the policy exist in the right namespace? (2) Does your CNI support NetworkPolicy? (3) Policies are namespace-scoped — a policy in namespace A cannot affect pods in namespace B (except via namespaceSelector).
