            <div class="cka-practice-drill">
                <h4>🔬 Practice Drill 21.4 — Diagnose a Wrong hostPath <code>type</code> Stuck in ContainerCreating</h4>
                <div class="drill-timer">⏱️ Target Time: 6 minutes</div>
