            <div class="uth-body">
            <h5>🗺️ PV-PVC Binding Algorithm — How Kubernetes Matches Claims to Volumes</h5>
            <p>The persistent volume controller — a control loop running INSIDE <code>kube-controller-manager</code>, not a separate process — continuously watches for Pending PVCs and pairs them with matching PVs. For dynamic provisioning, a separate <strong>external-provisioner sidecar</strong> container running alongside each CSI driver watches PVCs referencing its StorageClass and calls the storage backend to create the disk. Understanding the exact matching criteria helps you debug "PVC stuck in Pending" issues.</p>
