            <div class="cka-gotcha">
                <h4>RBAC Exam Traps</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li>❌ <span class="gotcha-wrong">ClusterRoleBinding can reference a Role</span></li>
                    <li>✅ <span class="gotcha-correct">ClusterRoleBinding can ONLY reference a ClusterRole — never a Role</span></li>
                    <li>❌ <span class="gotcha-wrong">A RoleBinding with a ClusterRole gives cluster-wide access</span></li>
                    <li>✅ <span class="gotcha-correct">RoleBinding + ClusterRole = ClusterRole permissions scoped to THAT namespace only</span></li>
                    <li><code>apiGroups: [""]</code> means core API — pods, services, configmaps. Apps group needs <code>["apps"]</code></li>
                    <li>Verbs are: <code>get</code>, <code>list</code>, <code>watch</code>, <code>create</code>, <code>update</code>, <code>patch</code>, <code>delete</code>, <code>deletecollection</code></li>
                    <li>ServiceAccount subject format: <code>system:serviceaccount:&lt;namespace&gt;:&lt;name&gt;</code></li>
                    <li><code>kubectl auth can-i</code> returns "yes"/"no" — use <code>--list</code> to see ALL permissions</li>
