                        <div class="eq-answer-label">Answer</div>
                        <div class="process-steps">
                            <div class="process-step-item active"><div class="step-number">1</div><h5>Key + CSR</h5><p><code>openssl genrsa</code> then <code>openssl req -new</code> with <code>/CN=dev/O=easypj-devs</code></p></div>
