                            <div class="process-step-item"><div class="step-number">5</div><h5>Kubeconfig</h5><p><code>set-credentials</code> + <code>set-context</code> with the cert+key</p></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="code-block-wrapper">
                            <div class="code-block-header"><span class="code-dot red"></span><span class="code-dot yellow"></span><span class="code-dot green"></span><span class="code-lang">the 5 steps as real commands</span></div>
                            <pre><code class="language-bash">openssl genrsa -out dev.key 2048
openssl req -new -key dev.key -out dev.csr -subj "/CN=dev/O=easypj-devs"
