                        <div class="eq-explanation">
                            <div class="eq-exp-label">Explanation</div>
                            <p>CSR management: <code>kubectl certificate approve|deny</code> to handle requests. CSRs have three possible states: Pending, Approved, Denied. On the CKA, you'll see Pending CSRs (e.g., from node bootstrapping or user cert requests). <code>kubectl get csr</code> lists all with status. Key: CSRs don't auto-delete — clean up with <code>kubectl delete csr</code>. The CONDITION column shows the current state. Node bootstrap CSRs use <code>kubernetes.io/kubelet-serving</code> as signerName.</p>
                        </div>
                    </details>
