  🗄️  Photocopy the guest ledger, lock it away ──▶  Ch 29 — etcd snapshot save (and a tested restore)
  🚪 Relocate one floor's guests, not all      ──▶  Ch 30 — cordon · drain · uncordon, node by node
  📋 Hotel never drops below min. occupancy    ──▶  PodDisruptionBudget guarantees minAvailable replicas</pre>
