                        <div class="eq-explanation">
                            <div class="eq-exp-label">Explanation</div>
                            <p>Upgrade order is CRITICAL: kubeadm first → <code>kubeadm upgrade apply</code> → kubelet + kubectl → restart. Always <code>apt-mark hold</code> after installing to prevent accidental upgrades. <code>kubeadm upgrade plan</code> shows what will be upgraded and if there are prerequisites. On the CKA, this exact sequence is tested — you must know it by heart. Static pods (API server, etcd, etc.) restart automatically during <code>kubeadm upgrade apply</code>.</p>
