                    <div class="eq-question">Take a snapshot of etcd and save it to <code>/opt/etcd-backup.db</code>. Show the complete command with all required flags.</div>
                    <details>
                        <summary>Show Answer</summary>
                            <div class="eq-answer-label">Answer</div>
                            <div class="code-block-wrapper">
                                <div class="code-block-header"><span class="code-dot red"></span><span class="code-dot yellow"></span><span class="code-dot green"></span><span class="code-lang">find cert paths from etcd pod</span></div>
