            <!-- ─────────── VISUAL SUMMARY ─────────── -->
            <div class="visual-summary">
                <div class="diagram-title">📌 Chapter 29 Visual Summary — Backup, Restore, and Automate etcd</div>
<div class="diagram-box">
<pre>
  💾 BACKUP (live, needs TLS)          🔄 RESTORE (offline, no TLS)          🤖 AUTOMATE
  ┌────────────────────────┐          ┌─────────────────────────┐          ┌───────────────────┐
