                                <td>✅ Yes</td>
                                <td>❌ No — pods stay</td>
                                <td>Prevent new pods before planned maintenance</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td><code>kubectl drain &lt;node&gt;</code></td>
                                <td>✅ Yes (implicit cordon)</td>
                                <td>✅ Yes — evicts all</td>
                                <td>Remove ALL workloads before maintenance</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td><code>kubectl uncordon &lt;node&gt;</code></td>
                                <td>❌ Removes mark</td>
                                <td>N/A</td>
                                <td>Make node schedulable again after maintenance</td>
                            </tr>
                        </tbody>
