│                                                                          │
│  t=0s   Rolling update begins (new image pushed)                         │
│         Deployment's OWN strategy.rollingUpdate.maxUnavailable=1 takes   │
│         down Pod-old-1 to replace it                                     │
│         → disruptionsAllowed drops to 0 (the ONE allowed slot is used    │
│           by the rollout itself, not by anything you triggered)          │
