│  t=5s   You separately start: kubectl drain worker03 --ignore-daemonsets │
│         worker03 happens to host Pod-old-3 — SAME Deployment, SAME PDB   │
│         Eviction API checks the PDB: disruptionsAllowed = 0 → HTTP 429   │
│         DRAIN BLOCKS — waiting on a rollout it doesn't even know exists  │
│                                                                          │
