                <h5>⚡ Speed Tips</h5>
                <p><strong>CKA Speed Tip — Pod debug flow (memorize):</strong><br>
                1. <code>kubectl get pod &lt;name&gt; -o wide</code> — status + node<br>
                2. <code>kubectl describe pod &lt;name&gt;</code> — events at bottom tell the story<br>
