            <div class="uth-body">
            <h5>🗺️ Node NotReady — Systematic Diagnosis Flow</h5>
            <p>A node going NotReady is one of the most common CKA scenarios. The kubelet stops reporting heartbeats, and the node controller marks it NotReady after ~40 seconds.</p>
            <div class="uth-diagram"><pre>
