                            <div class="eq-answer-label">Answer</div>
                            <div class="code-block-wrapper">
                                <div class="code-block-header"><span class="code-dot red"></span><span class="code-dot yellow"></span><span class="code-dot green"></span><span class="code-lang">symptom: pods stuck in containercreating</span></div>
                            <pre><code class="language-bash"><span class="comment"># Symptom: Pods stuck in ContainerCreating</span>
kubectl describe pod stuck-pod
<span class="comment"># Warning  FailedCreatePodSandBox</span>
