<span class="comment"># Step 1: Check CNI plugin is installed</span>
ls /etc/cni/net.d/
<span class="comment"># Should contain config files like:</span>
<span class="comment"># 10-calico.conflist  OR  10-weave.conflist</span>

<span class="comment"># If empty → CNI plugin not installed!</span>

<span class="comment"># Step 2: Check CNI plugin pods</span>
kubectl get pods -n kube-system | grep -E "calico|weave|flannel"
<span class="comment"># calico-node-abc12   0/1   CrashLoopBackOff  ← Problem!</span>

