                            <p><code>--field-selector spec.nodeName=</code> filters pods by node. On the CKA, <code>kubectl describe node</code> shows Capacity, Allocatable, and Allocated Resources — this tells you total vs available vs used. <code>kubectl top node</code> shows real-time usage. Key CKA scenario: scheduling failure because node is at capacity — use <code>describe node</code> to see Allocated vs Allocatable resources to confirm.</p>
                        </div>
                    </details>
                </div>
