                <div class="info-box tip">
                    <h5>💡 Warm-Up Delay Is Not a Bug</h5>
                    <p>Right after <code>kubectl apply</code>, <code>kubectl top</code> may report <strong>"Metrics API not available"</strong> for ~15-30 seconds while metrics-server performs its first scrape cycle. Wait for <code>kubectl -n kube-system rollout status deploy metrics-server</code> to confirm readiness, then retry — don't waste exam time debugging something that just needs a moment to warm up.</p>
                </div>

