                        <div class="eq-explanation">
                            <div class="eq-exp-label">Explanation</div>
                            <p>CKA exam frequently asks you to write output to specific files. Use <code>></code> to redirect. Key patterns: <code>kubectl logs pod > file</code>, <code>kubectl logs pod | grep error > file</code>, <code>kubectl top pods --sort-by=cpu --no-headers | head -1 | awk '{print $1}' > file</code>. Always verify: <code>cat /opt/answer.txt</code> to confirm the content is correct. Use pipe + grep + awk for extracting specific values.</p>
