                <div class="diagram-container">
                    <h4>🔴 Worker Node NotReady — Step-by-Step Walkthrough</h4>
                    <div class="diagram-box">
                    <pre>
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  1. IDENTIFY:                                                           │
│     $ kubectl get nodes                                                 │
│     NAME       STATUS     ROLES    AGE   VERSION                        │
│     master     Ready      master   30d   v1.31.0                        │
│     worker01   NotReady   &lt;none&gt;   30d   v1.31.0    ◄── PROBLEM        │
│     worker02   Ready      &lt;none&gt;   30d   v1.31.0                        │
│                                                                         │
│  2. GATHER — Describe the node:                                         │
│     $ kubectl describe node worker01                                    │
│     Conditions:                                                         │
│       Ready   False   KubeletNotReady   container runtime not running   │
│                                                                         │
│  3. ANALYZE — SSH to the node:                                          │
│     $ ssh worker01                                                      │
│     $ systemctl status kubelet                                          │
