                <h4>Scenario 2: Pod Stuck in Pending</h4>
                <div class="info-box warning">
                    <h5>⚠️ Problem</h5>
                    <p><code>easypj-web</code> pod in the <code>easypj</code> namespace is stuck in <code>Pending</code> state and won't schedule.</p>
