                <h4>🔬 Practice Drill 34.4 — Cascading Failure: One Root Cause, Three Symptoms</h4>
                <div class="drill-timer">⏱️ Target Time: 20 minutes</div>
                <div class="drill-scenario">
                    <h5>Scenario</h5>
