<span class="comment"># worker02   NotReady   &lt;none&gt;   40d   ← the root cause lives here</span>
ssh worker02 "systemctl status kubelet"
<span class="comment"># Active: inactive (dead)</span>
ssh worker02 "sudo systemctl start kubelet"

<span class="comment"># Step 2 — Re-check: did the "unrelated" symptoms self-resolve?</span>
