                    <h4>✅ Verify: HA Setup Checklist</h4>
                    <ul>
                        <li><code>nc -zv -w 2 &lt;LOAD_BALANCER_IP&gt; &lt;PORT&gt;</code> — quick TCP reachability test of the LB itself, before you even touch kubeadm</li>
