<span class="comment"># - Initial cluster created with --control-plane-endpoint</span>
<span class="comment"># - Load balancer configured for existing + new CP node</span>
<span class="comment"># - New node meets prerequisites (OS, container runtime, kubeadm)</span>

<span class="comment"># Step 1: On existing control plane, generate join command</span>
kubeadm token create --print-join-command
<span class="comment"># kubeadm join lb.example.com:6443 --token abc123 \</span>
<span class="comment">#   --discovery-token-ca-cert-hash sha256:xyz789</span>

<span class="comment"># Step 2: Upload certificates (need key for new CP node)</span>
kubeadm init phase upload-certs --upload-certs
<span class="comment"># [upload-certs] Using certificate key: abc123def456...</span>

<span class="comment"># Step 3: On new node, join as control plane</span>
