                            <div class="code-block-wrapper">
                                <div class="code-block-header"><span class="code-dot red"></span><span class="code-dot yellow"></span><span class="code-dot green"></span><span class="code-lang">production ha readiness checklist</span></div>
                            <pre><code class="language-bash"><span class="comment"># Production HA Readiness Checklist:</span>

