<span class="comment"># Custom roles set up, no default service account abuse</span>

<span class="comment"># 10. Certificate Expiration</span>
kubeadm certs check-expiration
<span class="comment"># All certs valid, auto-renewal configured</span>

<span class="comment"># 11. Network Policies</span>
kubectl get networkpolicies -A
<span class="comment"># Default deny + explicit allow rules</span>

<span class="comment"># 12. Storage</span>
kubectl get sc
<span class="comment"># StorageClass with appropriate reclaim policy (Retain for prod)</span></code></pre>
