<span class="comment"># 2. 6 members: quorum = floor(6/2)+1 = 4 → tolerated failures = 6-4 = 2</span>
<span class="comment">#    5 members: quorum = floor(5/2)+1 = 3 → tolerated failures = 5-3 = 2</span>
<span class="comment">#    SAME tolerance (2) for both — the 6th member adds cost/latency for zero gain</span>

