                    <p>The Cluster Autoscaler <strong>respects PDBs</strong> during scale-down. If removing a node would violate a PodDisruptionBudget (e.g., easypj's <code>minAvailable: 2</code>), the node won't be removed. This is why PDBs are important even with autoscaling!</p>
