                <div class="info-box tip">
                    <h5>💡 Pause Pods — Pre-warming Node Capacity</h5>
                    <p>Node provisioning takes 2-5 minutes. To avoid cold-start delays, some teams deploy <strong>"pause pods"</strong> — low-priority pods that reserve node capacity but do nothing. When real pods need space, the pause pods are evicted (they have <code>PriorityClass: low</code>), and real pods are scheduled instantly. The CA then provisions new nodes to replace the displaced pause pods in the background.</p>
