            <strong>🔑 CKA Insight:</strong> The CKA is distribution-neutral but may reference cloud concepts. Key differences from self-managed: you CANNOT SSH into control plane nodes, etcd is fully managed (no manual backup needed), upgrades are handled by the provider, and you must use cloud-specific CSI drivers and CNI plugins. For the exam, focus on the kubeadm-based cluster management — cloud specifics are supplementary knowledge.
