2. COMPARE:  desired replicas=5  vs  actual: no Deployment exists yet
3. ACT:      create Deployment easypj-web with replicas: 5, Service, ConfigMap
4. UPDATE:   write DjangoApp.status.phase = "Running", availableReplicas = 5
5. REPEAT:   re-watch; if someone edits replicas to 8, steps 2-4 fire again</pre>
