┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  IMAGE AUTOMATION — Registry → Git commit, with NO human editing YAML       │
│                                                                              │
│  1. CI builds &amp; pushes:  ghcr.io/user/easypj:v2.2  (new tag appears)        │
│                                    │                                          │
│                                    ▼                                          │
│  2. IMAGE AUTOMATION CONTROLLER watches the registry:                        │
│  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐    │
│  │  ArgoCD Image Updater:                Flux image-reflector +        │    │
│  │  runs alongside ArgoCD, polls          image-automation-controller: │    │
│  │  registries on an interval, writes     watches registries, writes   │    │
│  │  new tag into Application annotations  new tag into a Git commit    │    │
│  │  OR commits directly to the repo       via a marker comment in YAML │    │
│  │  (git-write-back mode)                 (image: easypj:v2.1 # {"$imagepolicy": ...}) │
│  └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘    │
│                                    │                                          │
│                                    ▼                                          │
│  3. Git repo gets an AUTOMATED commit:                                       │
│     "chore(easypj): update image tag to v2.2 [bot]"                          │
│                                    │                                          │
│                                    ▼                                          │
