                            <div class="eq-exp-label">Explanation</div>
                            <p>This drill tests the complete deployment lifecycle. On the CKA: <code>create deploy</code> (imperative, fast), <code>set image</code> (update), <code>rollout status</code> (verify), <code>rollout history</code> (check revisions), <code>rollout undo</code> (rollback). Use <code>annotate</code> with <code>kubernetes.io/change-cause</code> to label each revision. Practice this workflow until it's muscle memory — 2 minutes or less. These commands appear in almost every CKA exam.</p>
