<span class="comment"># Step 4: Watch ArgoCD detect it</span>
argocd app get easypj
<span class="comment"># Sync Status:   OutOfSync   ← drift detected!</span>

<span class="comment"># Step 5: Wait a few seconds (or force it):</span>
argocd app sync easypj
argocd app get easypj
<span class="comment"># Sync Status:   Synced      ← selfHeal reverted replicas back to Git's value</span>

kubectl get deploy easypj-web -n easypj-production
<span class="comment"># REPLICAS back to whatever overlays/production/patch-replicas.yaml specifies</span>

<span class="comment"># Step 6: Confirm it in history</span>
argocd app history easypj</code></pre>
