                        <tr><td><a href="#s40-7">40.7</a></td><td>Multi-Tenancy — Stacking Per-Namespace Controls</td><td>How do cooperating teams share one cluster safely?</td><td>RBAC + ResourceQuota + LimitRange + default-deny NetworkPolicy + PSA=restricted, stacked per namespace</td></tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
