            <div class="visual-summary">
                <div class="diagram-title">📌 Chapter 40 Visual Summary — The 6-Layer Defense Around easypj</div>
<div class="diagram-box">
<pre>
   🏗️ INFRA        hardened nodes, restricted kubelet, firewalled ports
        │
        ▼
   🔐 AuthN/Z      least-privilege RBAC, no anonymous-auth, SA hygiene,
                    watch escalate/bind/impersonate/*
        │
        ▼
   🧪 ADMISSION    PodSecurity=restricted, ValidatingAdmissionPolicy,
                    registry allowlist
        │
        ▼
