                <div class="exam-question-item">
                    <span class="eq-number">Q4</span>
                    <div class="eq-question">Create a Deployment with topology spread constraints that distributes pods evenly across nodes (maxSkew=1, DoNotSchedule). Deploy 4 replicas of the easypj app.</div>
