                    <h5>📖 UNDER-THE-HOOD — see Ch38 §38.4 for the full config-field table</h5>
                    <p><code>kubectl get apiservices</code> lists every API group and whether it is Local (built-in) or backed by a Service (aggregated). A metrics-server that's down shows its APIService as not <code>Available</code>, which is why <code>kubectl top</code> fails — the aggregation layer can't reach the backend. For the full APIService spec fields and how to register your own aggregated apiserver, see Chapter 38 §38.4.</p>
