kubectl get mutatingwebhookconfiguration easypj-injector -o yaml
kubectl delete validatingwebhookconfiguration &lt;bad-one&gt;
<span class="comment"># then fix root cause (restart webhook pod / fix caBundle) and redeploy the config</span></code></pre>
                        <div class="eq-explanation">
