                            <p>List the webhook configs first to confirm and identify the culprit, then delete/fix the offending Validating/MutatingWebhookConfiguration (or restore its webhook pod / caBundle). Deleting is the fast recovery; redeploying it correctly is the follow-up, not optional.</p>
                        </div>
                    </details>
                </div>

