                <div class="exam-question-item">
                    <span class="eq-number">Q7</span>
                    <div class="eq-question">CRD vs API aggregation — recap the distinction and give one real example of each.</div>
                    <details>
                        <summary>Show Answer</summary>
                        <div class="eq-answer-label">Answer</div>
                        <div class="card-grid cols-2">
                            <div class="info-card">
                                <h5>📋 CRD</h5>
                                <p>Adds declarative types stored by K8s in etcd (paired with a controller). Example: your easypj <code>DjangoApp</code> CRDs.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="info-card">
                                <h5>🧩 API Aggregation</h5>
                                <p>Registers a SEPARATE apiserver via an APIService for custom logic/storage. Example: metrics-server serving <code>metrics.k8s.io</code>.</p>
