<span class="comment">#   Internal error occurred: failed calling webhook "inject.easypj.example.com":</span>
<span class="comment">#   failed to call webhook: Post "https://easypj-injector.easypj-system.svc:443/mutate":</span>
<span class="comment">#   dial tcp: connect: connection refused</span>

<span class="comment"># Fastest safe recovery — delete the offending config, restore later</span>
