<span class="comment"># check it carries the SAME "release: kube-prometheus-stack" label the</span>
<span class="comment"># Prometheus CR's serviceMonitorSelector requires — a missing/wrong label</span>
<span class="comment"># here means it's silently never compiled into scrape config, no error raised</span>

<span class="comment"># 2. Check the Prometheus UI's own view of targets</span>
