                <h4>🔬 Practice Drill 44.1 — Right-Size a Real Workload, End to End</h4>
                <div class="drill-timer">⏱️ Target Time: 8 minutes</div>
                <div class="drill-scenario">
                    <h5>Scenario</h5>
                    <p>On any cluster (Minikube/kind is fine), deploy a workload with deliberately oversized requests, install <strong>metrics-server</strong>, wait for real usage data, compare <code>kubectl top</code> against the declared requests, and patch in right-sized values. Then add an HPA on the corrected baseline.</p>
