            <section class="section-block" id="s45-5">
                <h3 class="section-h">45.5 Top 10 Point-Losers</h3>
                <p>These ten mistakes account for the overwhelming majority of points lost by candidates who <em>knew</em> the material. None of them are knowledge gaps — they're process failures, and every single one is avoidable once you know to watch for it.</p>

