                <div class="info-box note">
                    <h5>🏗️ Domain 1 · Cluster Architecture, Installation &amp; Configuration <span class="cka-weight">25%</span></h5>
                    <p>Task 1 through Task 5 — namespace + RBAC bootstrap, kubeadm upgrade, etcd backup/restore, static pods, and CSR approval.</p>
