                    <div class="drill-timer">⏱️ ~7 min · 🎯 Weight ~6%</div>
                    <div class="drill-scenario">
                        <h5>Task</h5>
                        <p>In <code>easypj-production</code>, deploy PostgreSQL as a <strong>StatefulSet</strong> named <code>postgres</code> (1 replica, image <code>postgres:16</code>), with a <code>volumeClaimTemplates</code> entry requesting a <strong>2Gi</strong> PVC mounted at <code>/var/lib/postgresql/data</code>. Set env var <code>POSTGRES_PASSWORD</code> from a literal for now (Task 7 will move real secrets to a proper Secret). Add a <code>readinessProbe</code> that runs <code>pg_isready</code>.</p>
