                    <div class="drill-hint">
                        <strong>Hint:</strong> StatefulSets are too complex to fully generate imperatively — <code>kubectl create deployment</code> won't give you <code>volumeClaimTemplates</code>. Generate a Deployment skeleton with $do for the container fields, then hand-adapt it to <code>kind: StatefulSet</code> plus <code>serviceName</code> and <code>volumeClaimTemplates</code>.
