                    <p>Everything in this chapter assumes one fact you've never directly seen: <strong>a script, not a human, reads your cluster</strong> after you submit. Understanding that pipeline — and the exam's own remote-desktop quirks — explains <em>why</em> every rule in §45.1–§45.7 exists.</p>
                    <pre class="uth-diagram">
   ┌───────────────── HOW A TASK IS AUTO-GRADED (after you submit) ─────────────────┐
