   │        object exists?  →  right namespace?  →  right name?  →  right spec?    │
   │        │ yes                    │ yes              │ yes           │ yes      │
   │        ▼                        ▼                  ▼               ▼          │
   │      ✅ point awarded for THIS sub-check  (others are graded independently)     │
   │                                                                                │
