                <div class="exam-question-item">
                    <span class="eq-number">Q7</span>
                    <div class="eq-question">A Service in a troubleshooting task has no endpoints. What's your fix approach?</div>
                    <details>
                        <summary>Show Answer</summary>
                        <div class="eq-answer-label">Answer</div>
                        <p>Compare the Service's <code>selector</code> to the pods' actual <code>labels</code>, and confirm the pods are passing readiness — not just <code>Running</code>. Align whichever one drifted; only Ready, label-matched pods populate an EndpointSlice.</p>
                        <table>
                            <thead><tr><th>Check</th><th>Command</th></tr></thead>
                            <tbody>
                                <tr><td>Endpoints</td><td><code>kubectl get endpointslices</code></td></tr>
                                <tr><td>Service selector</td><td><code>kubectl get svc &lt;name&gt; -o yaml</code></td></tr>
                                <tr><td>Pod labels</td><td><code>kubectl get pods --show-labels</code></td></tr>
                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                        <div class="eq-explanation">
                            <div class="eq-exp-label">Explanation</div>
