<div class="diagram-box">
<pre>
  62% overall could mean MANY different things:
    lost mostly in Troubleshooting (30% weight) → re-read Ch 31-34, drill more
    lost mostly in Architecture (25% weight)    → re-read Ch 3,9-12,24,28
    a few scattered small losses everywhere     → re-verify your setup ritual
