            <div class="exam-question-item">
                <span class="eq-number">Q1</span>
                <div class="eq-question">Generate a Deployment manifest for <code>easypj-web</code> (3 replicas, image <code>easypj/jobpost:1.0</code>) without writing YAML by hand.</div>
                <details>
                    <summary>Show Answer</summary>
                    <div class="eq-answer-label">Answer</div>
                    <div class="code-block-wrapper">
                        <div class="code-block-header"><span class="code-dot red"></span><span class="code-dot yellow"></span><span class="code-dot green"></span><span class="code-lang">generate-then-edit</span></div>
<pre><code class="language-bash">kubectl create deploy easypj-web --image=easypj/jobpost:1.0 --replicas=3 \
  --dry-run=client -o yaml &gt; easypj-web.yaml
<span class="comment"># with the $do alias from A.9: k create deploy easypj-web --image=easypj/jobpost:1.0 --replicas=3 $do &gt; easypj-web.yaml</span></code></pre>
