                    <div class="eq-explanation">
                        <div class="eq-exp-label">Explanation</div>
                        <p>This is the A.9 generate-then-edit pattern applied to A.3's <code>create deployment</code> command. <code>--dry-run=client -o yaml</code> renders a fully-formed, schema-valid manifest with zero API calls — redirect it to a file, then hand-edit only the fields the generator can't infer (probes, resource limits, volumes).</p>
