            <div class="cka-gotcha">
                <h5>⚠️ StatefulSet Gotchas</h5>
                <ul>
                    <li><code>clusterIP: None</code> makes a <strong>headless</strong> service — required for StatefulSet DNS (<code>easypj-postgres-0.easypj-postgres.easypj.svc.cluster.local</code>)</li>
